  "bio": "Tassio Mioon is renowned for his exceptional skill in crafting minimalist tattoos that demonstrate both intricacy and elegance. His clear-cut lines and delicate shading techniques have earned him a prestigious reputation in the world of tattoo artistry. Patrons of his art not only leave with a stunning piece of art but also praise the professionalism that Tassio maintains throughout the tattooing process, ensuring a satisfactory and comfortable experience for all his clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nAnanindeua/PA\nTatuador | Body Piercing \n| Produtor | Dj | Cantor | Surfista \n@magehstudio @manivaartstudio @noturneiravibe @magehmusic @seumaniva\n\nAnanindeua/PA\nTatuador | Body Piercing \n| Produtor | Dj | Cantor | Surfista \n@magehstudio @manivaartstudio @noturneiravibe @magehmusic @seumaniva",
